\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Caret-drop rate by priming condition ($n{=}138$ primed / $n{=}648$ unprimed; same three endpoints). \textbf  {CROSS-RUN comparison; prompt batteries differ (primed vs.\ unprimed); not randomized---topic conflation possible.} Effect sizes and exact $p$-values in Table\nobreakspace  {}\ref  {tab:contrasts} and \S  4.4: the occurrence-level contrast is large and robust ($p{=}6.2\times 10^{-28}$); the text-level leg is \emph  {not} significant ($p{=}0.074$).\relax }}{6}{table.caption.4}\protected@file@percent }
